::CW_U01_UA_Q29::
[MLA.CW.WR.05] Question ID: CW_U01_UA_Q29
MLA Standard: MLA.CW.COM.05
Which action shows active listening during a Creative Writing workshop?{
~A. Planning your own response while the writer is still reading.#Incorrect. Active listening requires attention to the speaker's words before preparing your response.
=B. Taking notes on specific words, images, or moments you may discuss after the writer finishes.#Correct. This shows attention and prepares specific feedback.
~C. Interrupting to correct every sentence immediately.#Incorrect. Interrupting prevents the writer from sharing the piece fully.
~D. Looking away and waiting for the quiz to begin.#Incorrect. This does not show engagement with the writer or the discussion.
}

